data.frame(names = net2 %v% "vertex.names",? ? ? ? ? ?degree = degree(net2, gmode = "graph") ,? ? ? ? ? ?degree.mat = degree(as.sociomatrix(net2), gmode = "graph"))
There is a 2->7 and 7->2 tie that is not double counted.?

