    Yes Jeffery,

    Network data management in tergm is handled by the networkDynamic package. 
    Per the networkDynamic documentation the `vertex.pid` argument should be 
    the name of a vertex attribute (which should be present in each network in 
    the input list). The values are used as vertex unique IDs across networks 
    in the input list.

    HTH,
    Martina

